  "oxytocin": "IV oxytocin: pump on a secondary line; stop for tachysystole.", "digoxin": "Narrow therapeutic index: check apical pulse, potassium and levels.",
  "glipizide": "Oral sulfonylurea: prolonged hypoglycemia risk, especially in older adults.", "epoprostenol": "Continuous infusion: never interrupt; never flush the line.",
  "vincristine": "IV only. Fatal if given intrathecally; dispense in a minibag.", "cyclophosphamide": "Chemotherapy: verify protocol, dose and hydration; mesna as ordered."
